{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And to the children of Israel, etc.</b> The reason for His saying <b>and to the children of Israel</b> is that He intends to warn the entirety of Israel to kill the one who gives of his seed to Molech, and He said it with the addition of the letter vav to convey that besides the obligation upon the one who passes [his child through fire], there is also an obligation upon all the people to punish him."], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:59:43.506897203Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}